('privacy', 'Privacy Policy', 'Legal', 'IN', 'en-US', 'in-privacy-2026.1', '2026-06-01', '2026-06-05', 1, 'Privacy Policy for IN', 'This privacy notice applies to visitors detected in India and explains how Sharity presents country-relevant legal notices and marketplace availability.', TRUE, TRUE),
